00,"rawContent":"Those vague, worried emails we keep getting from men post #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/yiw6OajzGL https:\/\/t.co\/4sgxLlZyEz","media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/DThnPx0VMAATG9f?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"avflox","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"953812275365789696","date":1516241542000,"rawContent":"@JuliaMarkD I know what you mean about #metoo. It's been dredging things up for me, too. I'm really grateful for Accelerated Experiential Dynamic Psychotherapy for processing the phantom feelings of experiences I couldn't really face at the time.","media":null,"username":"avflox","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"953898256722882560","date":1516262041000,"rawContent":"You're going to drag @k80way, who gave a survivor a platform, because she dissed an established journalist's lipstick? After that journalist participated in normalizing men's refusal to acknowledge soft nos and directly called out a survivor as an enemy of #metoo? https:\/\/t.co\/Ws1UPuBOGw","media":[{"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/tweet_video_thumb\/DTztZXMUQAAlyik.jpg","variants":["https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/tweet_video\/DTztZXMUQAAlyik.mp4"]}],"username":"avflox","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumO